  "label": "Antichrist (Christian theological concept)",
  "description": "The Antichrist is a figure in Christian eschatology who is expected to appear before the end of the world, opposing Christ and leading a false religion. Labeling someone an 'antichrist' is a theological accusation of being the ultimate enemy of God and Christianity. The meme uses this term to falsely accuse Pope Francis, which is a religiously motivated hate label.",
